    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496890/extras/863b4c81d1ee1edc00844505376ecb75.poster.avif?t=1755611762\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496890/extras/863b4c81d1ee1edc00844505376ecb75.webm?t=1755611762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496890/extras/9c10b71f3b1bbf35bcef1ee96bb4ed0c.avif?t=1755611762\" width=375 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Slot or not</strong>&quot; is a <strong>deck-building turn-based </strong>slot machine battling adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a nimble hare -\u00a0<strong>Bun Dorian</strong>, accompanied by a fighting slot machine called <strong>Slottie</strong>, who is trying to save his native village from the invasion of <strong>crazy fruits</strong> that have started to appear in the neighborhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure will give you <strong>unforgettable emotions</strong> and <strong>fun</strong>. And <strong>no</strong> <strong>gambling</strong> at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496890/extras/ec97fe93219a99f48431d05f90c36cd4.poster.avif?t=1755611762\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496890/extras/ec97fe93219a99f48431d05f90c36cd4.webm?t=1755611762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496890/extras/0ae7efbc5924bef7dec49c9536437b2b.avif?t=1755611762\" width=375 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Rogue-like game generation<br>\ud83c\udf92 20+ playable items you can carry in your bag<br>\ud83e\udd55 \ufe0f15+ game changing trinkets spices things up<br>\ud83d\udc79 5+ tricky enemies are lurking in the forest<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Original art. No AI chicanery<br>\ud83c\udfb5 Upbeat scores<br>\ud83c\udfb0 Slots without gambling (Goodbye addiction)<br>\u267e\ufe0f Endless gameplay</p>",
