 class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496890/extras/0ae7efbc5924bef7dec49c9536437b2b.avif?t=1755611762\" width=375 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Rogue-like game generation<br>\ud83c\udf92 20+ playable items you can carry in your bag<br>\ud83e\udd55 \ufe0f15+ game changing trinkets spices things up<br>\ud83d\udc79 5+ tricky enemies are lurking in the forest<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Original art. No AI chicanery<br>\ud83c\udfb5 Upbeat scores<br>\ud83c\udfb0 Slots without gambling (Goodbye addiction)<br>\u267e\ufe0f Endless gameplay</p>",
